  "2019 P1 Q5": {"v":"data.median-siqr-compare","marks":[1,2,1,1],"shows":[null,"\\(3.5\\) and \\(8\\)","On average, temperatures in Grantford are lower.",null],"marksLine":"5 marks","nudge":"What must you do to the list before you can pick out the median and the quartiles?","step":"Put the nine temperatures in order, smallest first. With nine values, the median is the 5th.","watch":"The semi-interquartile range is half of the interquartile range, not half of the range. In (b), name Grantford or Endoch in each comment."},
